  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Workforce &amp; Services (PHP 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support health sector decentralization in four provinces for sustainable financing and client-centered delivery of health services. Specific Objectives: 1. Improve financing and delivery of essential health services in the provinces of Jambi, East Kalimantan, West Kalimantan, and West Sumatera to enhance access to care, quality of care and health outcomes at the district level. 2. Strengthen health workforce policy, management and development in a decentralized context in order to improve allocational efficiencies and equity in the distribution and use of health resources in the districts. 3. Empower MOH, MONE and IMA, the three key stakeholders in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
